# 1. THE CORE PRODUCT IDEA

## Product name

EXHAUST

## Identity

**The Forensic Mirror for Your Digital Ghost.**

## Primary slogan

YOUR FILE IS TELLING ON YOU.

## Supporting tagline

What you see is not everything you share.

## The problem

People frequently share photographs, documents, and writing without understanding the information those materials can expose.

An image may reveal its capture location, camera manufacturer, device information, timestamp, and software metadata.

A PDF may expose author information, document properties, and indicators of past modifications.

Writing can reveal measurable stylistic patterns, although such patterns do not reliably identify an individual.

Public websites can expose technology choices, tracking infrastructure, and other observable information.

EXHAUST makes these details visible, explains them, and helps the user reduce unnecessary exposure.

## Primary user journey

DISCOVER → UPLOAD → X-RAY → UNDERSTAND → REDTEAM VIEW → SCRUB → VERIFY → DOWNLOAD

A user should be able to complete the essential journey without creating an account or entering any information beyond the chosen file.

